All requirements are met. The implementation in `src/App.jsx` correctly places the Analytics component within the Layout wrapper, which ensures it tracks all routes defined in the application.

### Next Steps for Deployment
To enable analytics on Vercel:
1. Deploy the project to Vercel
2. Navigate to the Vercel dashboard
3. Select "Analytics" in the sidebar
4. Choose the project and click "Enable"
5. Verify tracking by checking browser Network tab for requests to the analytics endpoint

